                "St. Augustine’s life is full of lessons, confusion, experiences, and determination—a life of learning and understanding humanity, guided by faith and wisdom. He is not just a saint; he was also a child, a student, and a young boy. His curiosity, however, was what led him to where he truly belonged. Today, the Augustinians of La Consolacion University Philippines learn about his life, his dedication, and his devotion—not only to study, but also to apply these lessons to their own lives.",
